{title: Bhalo Lage Na}
{artist: Hridoy Khan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Amon keno,        Khelo [F]amay niye
Peye [Dm]harabar betha,        Jao keno [E]diye
[Am]Jibon jeno,        Khelche [F]nithur khela
Bhalobasha [Dm]jay dheke,        [E]Obohelay hay
[Am]Keno avabe kadao,        [F]Jeno bhalobasha
[Dm]Kono hasi khelay,        [E]Purono bhalo lage na
